From dc65d4694ca56154ce2bce64fc82cd41df3dc275 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:45:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: spell audit groups 1-6 - CC adds, mana savers, damage,
 interrupts, defense strikes, racials (F-219)

Module:
- on_add uses the spell's max range (Polymorph 30, Fear 20, HoJ 10) and
  records cc_ms; a held add is never re-CC'd nor hit by our per-target DoTs
- Ability above_health_pct / below_power_pct (Life Tap, Bloodrage)
- after_defense: our dodge/parry/block (SMSG_ATTACKERSTATEUPDATE victim
  state 2/3, HITINFO_BLOCK) opens AURA_STATE_DEFENSE strikes for 5 s
Runner:
- CC the add: Polymorph, Fear, Hammer of Justice, Entangling Roots; Stoneclaw
  Totem at 2+ attackers
- mana: mage conjures water/food out of combat; Life Tap above 70 % health
  below 50 % mana; Renew below 70 %
- damage: Mind Blast opener, Flame Shock, Flametongue, Curse of Agony,
  Slice and Dice at 1-2 points, Bloodrage
- interrupts: Silencing Shot, Devout Silence, Solar Flare, Wind Shear,
  Counterspell
- Counter, Chastise, Earthen Reprisal after a dodge/parry/block
- racials per race (Blood Fury, Stoneform, War Stomp, Berserking, Rocket
  Barrage, Arcane Torrent, Gift of the Naaru); Arcane Torrent moved out of
  the paladin list

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
